    "DRAFT prepared on Windows from the macOS engineering records (docs/phase1-macos.md, docs/phase2-macos.md, toolchains/apio-remote-config/apio-1.7.x.jsonc). It has NOT been assembled or validated. The assembler refuses any recipe whose status is not 'validated'.",
    "Mac step (on an Apple-silicon Mac): confirm every version and URL against the validated Mac installation, download each archive, fill in size and sha256, compare the extracted content with ~/.apio/packages and tools/ghdl (scripts/toolchain/compare.mjs), then set status to 'validated'.",
    "Apio: the validated Apio 1.7.0 build was 'pyinst-darwin-arm64-2026-09-27' installed at /Applications/Apio/apio. Find the matching official darwin-arm64 bundle archive of the 2026-09-27 Apio release; if only an installer package exists, document how its payload is staged reproducibly.",
    "Python: openXC7's fasm2frames/bit2fasm/xc7pll scripts need a Python interpreter. On Windows they ran the developer's system Python (now replaced by the 'python' shim to the oss-cad-suite CPython). On macOS check which interpreter the scripts' shebang/wrappers resolve to (a clean Mac's /usr/bin/python3 is only a Command Line Tools installer stub) and add a shim to a bundled interpreter if needed; then prove byte-identical hardware.frames.",
    "openXC7 parts-index schema must be 7 for Apio 1.7.0 (openxc7 2026-09-25 is pinned because 2026-09-27 moved to schema 8).",
    "GHDL: Apio's bundled GHDL does not launch on macOS 27 (duplicate LC_RPATH); the validated GHDL is the official ghdl-llvm-6.0.0-macos15-aarch64 release."
  ],
